    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "LEGO bricks",
            "zh": "乐高积木"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " are among the world’s most popular toys. They can be a great hobby for both children and adults. For some adults, like Nathan Sawaya, Lego can even be a career."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Sawaya was a lawyer in the late 1990s. He would often do a "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "creative",
            "ref": "v-creative"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " activity after work. At first, he drew and painted. Then, one day, he thought of his childhood hobby. He began building works of Lego art. When he "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "posted",
            "ref": "v-post"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " his works online, people loved them."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "In 2004, Sawaya decided to leave his job and become a full-time Lego artist. Many people didn’t understand this, but he didn’t care. Three years later, Sawaya held his first "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "exhibition",
            "ref": "v-exhibition"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " "
          },
          {
            "t": "em",
            "v": "The Art of the Lego Brick|"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". It has been on display all over the world. At the exhibition, you’ll find almost everything. Landscapes, animals and many everyday items have been turned into Lego art."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "The artist hopes more people will be inspired by his work. “Maybe you can also build something for yourself using Lego bricks,” he said."
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
